<v Ira Glass>You know, I have asked him so many times over the years, over and over. And every time I get the same answer. I ask him, Torey, how many women have you slept with?
<v Ira Glass>你知道，多年来我问过他很多次，一遍又一遍。每次我都得到同样的答案。我问他：托里，你和多少个女人睡过觉？

00:56:23.150 --> 00:56:30.330
<v Benjamin>Quite a few, of course. Put it that way. There's been quite a few. But, you know, to give you a number off the top of my head, no. But there have been quite a few.
<v Benjamin>当然，不少。就这么说吧。已经有不少了。但，你知道，要让我直接给你一个数字，不。但已经有不少了。

00:56:30.330 --> 00:56:34.000
